<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Key Production started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Key Production started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co has started coverage of Key Production Co Inc with a rating of market outperform, a source at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The natural gas company's stock closed at a year high of 12-1/2 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
